Authorized access
-----------------
This repository is made technically available (including as a Git remote) so
that authorized AI coding agents (including Cursor and Lovable) acting on
behalf of Sharp or GCA Global personnel can read it while building and
operating the Sharp Matrix platform.

Access is authorized only for:

  • employees, contractors, and officers of Sharp and of GCA Global; and
  • AI agents (Cursor, Lovable, and similar) invoked by those people to
    perform work for Sharp or GCA Global.

Authorized agents may read and use this knowledge base solely to assist Sharp
or GCA Global personnel on Sharp Matrix work.

